Your melee attacks cripple your targets when they critically strike, lowering their movement speed by [15%, 20%, 24%, 27%, 30% (TL1-5)] and their accuracy by [7, 13, 16, 20, 24 (TL1-5)] for [3, 3, 4, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] turns.

Additionally, you gain [3%, 5%, 7%, 10%, 12% (TL1-5)] chance to critically strike with your melee attacks.
